  # Unlike stream(), this operation is eager and will load `limit` records into
  # memory before returning.
  #
  # @param from [String] A calling party. Could be an E.164 number, a SIP URI, or a Twilio Client registered name.
  # @param to [String] A called party. Could be an E.164 number, a SIP URI, or a Twilio Client registered name.
  # @param from_carrier [String] An origination carrier.
  # @param to_carrier [String] A destination carrier.
  # @param from_country_code [String] A source country code based on phone number in From.
  # @param to_country_code [String] A destination country code. Based on phone number in To.
  # @param verified_caller [Boolean] A boolean flag indicating whether or not the caller was verified using SHAKEN/STIR.One of 'true' or 'false'.
