  # @param start_time [String] A Start time of the calls. xm (x minutes), xh (x hours), xd (x days), 1w, 30m, 3d, 4w or datetime-ISO. Defaults to 4h.
  # @param end_time [String] An End Time of the calls. xm (x minutes), xh (x hours), xd (x days), 1w, 30m, 3d, 4w or datetime-ISO. Defaults to 0m.
  # @param call_type [String] A Call Type of the calls. One of `carrier`, `sip`, `trunking` or `client`.
  # @param call_state [String] A Call State of the calls. One of `ringing`, `completed`, `busy`, `fail`, `noanswer`, `canceled`, `answered`, `undialed`.
  # @param direction [String] A Direction of the calls. One of `outbound_api`, `outbound_dial`, `inbound`, `trunking_originating`, `trunking_terminating`.
