  # @param answered_by_annotation [String] Either machine or human.
  # @param connectivity_issue_annotation [String] A Connectivity Issue with the calls. One of `no_connectivity_issue`, `invalid_number`, `caller_id`, `dropped_call`, or `number_reachability`.
  # @param quality_issue_annotation [String] A subjective Quality Issue with the calls. One of `no_quality_issue`, `low_volume`, `choppy_robotic`, `echo`, `dtmf`, `latency`, `owa`, `static_noise`.
